cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "From the Risk-Neutral Measure to Girsanov's Theorem in Stochastic Integration: Pricing of Financial Products"
abstract: >-
  Bachelor's thesis in Mathematics (University of Oviedo) developing the theory
  of European option pricing via the martingale approach, from the binomial
  model to Girsanov's theorem and the Black-Scholes formula. Spanish original
  and English version, with LaTeX sources.
authors:
